{{!
    @template mod_youtubewpt/view

    YouTube WPT player mount point. The Preact app reads the JSON payload
    and initialises the YouTube IFrame player with progress tracking.

    Context variables required:
    * intro       string   Module intro HTML (may be empty).
    * payloadjson string   JSON-encoded bootstrap payload for the JS app.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "intro": "",
        "payloadjson": "{\"cmid\":1,\"videoid\":\"dQw4w9WgXcQ\",\"completionenabled\":true,\"completionprogress\":100,\"startprogress\":0}"
    }
}}
{{#intro}}
    <div class="mod_introbox">{{{intro}}}</div>
{{/intro}}

<div data-youtubewpt-root>
    <script type="application/json" data-youtubewpt-init>{{{payloadjson}}}</script>
</div>
